   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793836800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Paying alice.opaquepay.eth on Ethereum",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Paying alice.opaquepay.eth on Ethereum",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "te31",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 934,
   "y": 619.75,
   "width": 630.0000000000001,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g29"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1568777136,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1035401548,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1793836800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Read alice's ENS records through the mesh: a free lookup, no signature\n2. Her records hold an ML-KEM pay-to key\n3. Planned: derive a one-time payout address from that key,\n    so the payout doesn't name her account (a post-quantum stealth address)\n4. Steps 2 to 6, with that one-time address as the recipient",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. Read alice's ENS records through the mesh: a free lookup, no signature\n2. Her records hold an ML-KEM pay-to key\n3. Planned: derive a one-time payout address from that key,\n    so the payout doesn't name her account (a post-quantum stealth address)\n4. Steps 2 to 6, with that one-time address as the recipient",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "re32",
